"Bookings, revenue, margin, retention, and expansion"}, {"id": "d69a5c2e-dec8-4318-8798-1aabce449cec", "type": "concept", "title": "Leading versus lagging indicators"}], "description": "Students learn to separate what reps do, what they are able to do, and what results they produce."}, {"id": "9d4a8517-0cba-4381-b355-14c243665837", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Performance diagnosis", "children": [{"id": "fa2f5d71-38d6-461a-beda-c2cd3e481108", "type": "concept", "title": "Rep scorecards"}, {"id": "74e3f130-6abb-4b8d-ae24-815473c47514", "type": "concept", "title": "Funnel diagnostics"}, {"id": "94b00aa9-85a4-4b12-8216-9f6a5688d03b", "type": "concept", "title": "Win/loss analysis"}, {"id": "8bda44bb-37b5-4e2e-b456-ca107e280bac", "type": "concept", "title": "Root cause analysis"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches managers to identify whether performance issues come from effort, skill, territory, process, product-market fit, or management."}, {"id": "a2697e7c-5201-4838-a128-9832c62695a0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Performance improvement and accountability", "children": [{"id": "b480a616-fac7-4379-b5e3-b10f68173c52", "type": "concept", "title": "Coaching plans"}, {"id": "c569c8c9-1ede-45e3-93a7-aadf62719680", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance improvement plans"}, {"id": "5cd5b0b3-c6be-416a-9e2e-fd02a7847f71", "type": "concept", "title": "Recognition and promotion paths"}, {"id": "da5f8be9-5cc6-4c05-947d-6795035d086e", "type": "concept", "title": "Termination decisions and documentation"}], "description": "Students learn how to support improvement while maintaining standards."}]}, {"id": "bde95857-b618-415f-9452-2110fbf0519f", "type": "topic", "title": "CRM, Sales Technology, AI, and Enablement", "description": "Use CRM, sales engagement, conversation intelligence, enablement tools, and AI responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "2d78edf2-680b-4268-b3ab-2c88ed8db787", "type": "subtopic", "title": "CRM systems and data discipline", "children": [{"id": "14ad2b16-78c3-42d4-8019-0c27adc7a9f1", "type": "concept", "title": "Accounts, contacts, leads, opportunities, and activities"}, {"id": "0ac8edc6-e7fc-432e-be24-a638f26ff0df", "type": "concept", "title": "Pipeline stages and required fields"}, {"id": "7cd0c616-6bf8-486b-a758-7234b5cc7a9e", "type": "concept", "title": "Dashboards and reports"}, {"id": "77d86773-481e-4e8e-adf7-ee3d82b7c120", "type": "concept", "title": "Data hygiene and duplicate control"}], "description": "CRM is the system of record for customer relationships and sales execution. Students learn why adoption and data quality matter."}, {"id": "86c7b9b8-4656-46af-a012-02f5c62cb63d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sales technology stack", "children": [{"id": "09969d8d-5fa4-4376-881d-6946f17a6854", "type": "concept", "title": "Sales engagement platforms"}, {"id": "d13ca0e5-cc8c-4a4c-b9bd-3a1f99260147", "type": "concept", "title": "Conversation intelligence"}, {"id": "93b749c4-0d16-4c79-9d5a-b6bcc46ca1d5", "type": "concept", "title": "CPQ and proposal tools"}, {"id": "062e31e0-7b6b-4b87-a093-f2343b51a18b", "type": "concept", "title": "Enablement platforms and content management"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces tools that improve productivity, insight, and consistency when used thoughtfully."}, {"id": "44e379cc-871f-4f1c-9918-12117a8a82fa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "AI-assisted sales management", "children": [{"id": "4969108a-84b3-417a-a450-d62a88e9d77a", "type": "concept", "title": "Account research and call summaries"}, {"id": "5868d7c5-f6e0-49c7-bfc3-ae1d9cb9670e", "type": "concept", "title": "Coaching insights and forecasting support"}, {"id": "3e073e27-cd22-4e0b-9add-34c92c3014d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Personalized outreach drafts"}, {"id": "9892b1c2-f214-431c-999e-6a52d63ad69a", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy, bias, hallucination, and human review"}], "description": "Students learn practical uses and risks of AI in sales workflows."}]}, {"id": "adc62ecf-bb51-465e-a4a4-d282f5fe7d69", "type": "topic", "title": "Key Account Management, Customer Success, and Retention", "description": "Manage strategic accounts, executive relationships, renewals, expansion, and long-term value.", "children": [{"id": "a81334c6-64d3-466d-b864-de316b7aa907", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Strategic account planning", "children": [{"id": "5a31c2e5-ca48-4eee-ba01-9b42e2253b69", "type": "concept", "title": "Account maps and stakeholder influence"}, {"id": "12e1dd73-05ad-4ac3-a765-50aaf8c3022c", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive sponsorship"}, {"id": "fa808692-5b95-497c-a505-57c162bbe053", "type": "concept", "title": "Growth opportunities and whitespace"}, {"id": "38ebcc75-7244-4912-bfdb-a9dd7dfd4646", "type": "concept", "title": "Account plans and business reviews"}], "description": "Key accounts require a long-term relationship and value expansion approach. Students learn to manage complex account ecosystems."}, {"id": "446dbb77-4264-4b9a-acac-b776db84fa67", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Customer success and retention", "children": [{"id": "4797a404-0ea3-47a3-bd73-a9fc9cbde256", "type": "concept", "title": "Onboarding and adoption milestones"}, {"id": "b31d8b4e-6b06-4150-9e2e-15d3083f49ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Health scores and risk signals"}, {"id": "ca19c952-36e6-4d49-a52b-b17dcc2eb09b", "type": "concept", "title": "Renewal plays and expansion motions"}, {"id": "25209904-1c78-4a68-a0ef-b069b511e6d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Net revenue retention and churn"}], "description": "This subtopic connects sales management to renewal, adoption, satisfaction, and expansion."}, {"id": "aace045f-f541-4e21-8df4-00632aa76b65", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Long-term relationship governance", "children": [{"id": "07244e4d-007a-490f-ac1d-bfdc553cf688", "type": "concept", "title": "Quarterly business reviews"}, {"id": "055aeac9-2ec1-49f2-9ed0-d2462c2ae089", "type": "concept", "title": "Escalation management"}, {"id": "206d55d9-80dd-4ad9-8518-f06578c622fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Service recovery and relationship repair"}, {"id": "28401f5a-c415-4db0-ad16-9de207c111ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Joint value plans"}], "description": "Students learn to protect trust while pursuing growth."}]}, {"id": "c7ecf5ec-e980-4b54-9083-2ad32fbdf662", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethics, Legal Issues, DEI, and Professional Sales Practice", "description": "Apply ethical, legal, inclusive, and customer-trust standards to sales management decisions.", "children": [{"id": "ccb56c30-1974-46c2-97b5-e4d4e027bfee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethical selling and customer trust", "children": [{"id": "8d0df49b-d643-4f4f-a870-41d1ab4c1eb2", "type": "concept", "title": "Truthful claims and evidence"}, {"id": "b57ae273-7e40-4245-b819-2a20ec6348ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest and gifts"}, {"id": "1d0cff30-325b-4564-93c6-b3271ff90134", "type": "concept", "title": "High-pressure tactics and vulnerable customers"}, {"id": "f5d6f6f2-3dd9-4b99-aa8f-479f307869f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Long-term reputation"}], "description": "Students learn how pressure can distort judgment and how ethical standards protect the firm and customer."}, {"id": "d4ffb221-8882-4ac7-a93e-9faa4595a9d6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Legal and compliance issues", "children": [{"id": "51dc0eef-693a-4bbd-b829-a4c1188a744c", "type": "concept", "title": "Contracts and authority to bind"}, {"id": "c44af0cb-cbef-41e9-b02e-cabfd9d31df2", "type": "concept", "title": "Antitrust and price discrimination concerns"}, {"id": "d5336724-31f4-4a93-997f-09c47e7b3469", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy and data protection"}, {"id": "d6a7ae3f-9f14-4d7d-b19a-d8c314fd787e", "type": "concept", "title": "Industry-specific compliance"}], "description": "This subtopic covers legal basics that sales managers must recognize and escalate appropriately."}, {"id": "32958e6f-ce03-4602-99f5-3776a8b9a7b7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inclusive sales management", "children": [{"id": "46555315-ff3c-462c-8c3b-b8c504f45b77", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias in hiring and territory assignment"}, {"id": "89c4a1ea-ad8f-4a0a-8051-a83850ebeb5c", "type": "concept", "title": "Inclusive coaching and evaluation"}, {"id": "0a954f44-eb41-4d58-9728-c9fd78a2afbd", "type": "concept", "title": "Accessibility in selling materials"}, {"id": "b77d257c-f40d-45c1-948a-dc62e3335ce3", "type": "concept", "title": "Cross-cultural communication"}], "description": "Students learn how DEI affects hiring, coaching, customer interactions, and team culture."}]}, {"id": "73e2d628-3cd9-4e7e-8c88-5efc128f2e5b", "type": "topic", "title": "Sales Management Capstone Plan", "description": "Create an integrated sales management plan with structure, process, people, metrics, technology, and governance.", "children": [{"id": "76e14e08-2fb5-43da-9ff3-18129620bc52", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Market and sales organization diagnosis", "children": [{"id": "2bb7cb81-8029-42a9-8d94-e714a72e3955", "type": "concept", "title": "Target market and customer segments"}, {"id": "161e1734-966d-4bb2-a364-1c0305b6024a", "type": "concept", "title": "Sales roles and coverage model"}, {"id": "5bf0a293-e5a5-490b-b886-fdd2a45d744f", "type": "concept", "title": "Buyer journey and selling process"}, {"id": "f0c49a63-7170-4663-be7a-b134a1f6cb5d", "type": "concept", "title": "Current performance gaps"}], "description": "The capstone asks students to synthesize the whole course by diagnosing a sales situation and proposing a management plan."}, {"id": "dacd1b7d-7764-4e5f-a24e-4d056c1b10a4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "People, process, and technology plan", "children": [{"id": "eba67c85-e84f-4ac8-a65c-21411d0adc31", "type": "concept", "title": "Hiring and training plan"}, {"id": "5d9b22a3-1515-4beb-9a2c-efff929458f7", "type": "concept", "title": "Compensation and quota logic"}, {"id": "b1f06fc9-8a31-45f8-8b25-38d4372ad651", "type": "concept", "title": "CRM and sales technology requirements"}, {"id": "69108d67-f80f-47b5-abab-82ddaa2b8720", "type": "concept", "title": "Coaching and operating cadence"}], "description": "Students design the operating system needed to execute the strategy."}, {"id": "0f003d50-9340-4b7c-8933-a88da7b39eef", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Metrics, risks, and implementation roadmap", "children": [{"id": "8a1bc443-ce89-438b-b31f-57ad9f94471b", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecast and dashboard design"}, {"id": "4ae920d2-d6b4-48db-9c9d-1203621fe09b", "type": "concept", "title": "Key risks and ethics review"}, {"id": "7ac8ec6a-b43a-4e1d-9fda-bd780b25e72b", "type": "concept", "title": "90-day implementation roadmap"}, {"id": "76d235f6-c2ab-46cb-ba2d-76a4ae75ad01", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive presentation and recommendations"}], "description": "The final part makes the plan actionable and testable."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$slsmjson$::jsonb,
