": "Common friction points across revenue teams"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces the modern revenue organization and clarifies how different teams share accountability for growth."}, {"id": "712cb2d3-228e-4c38-8077-9b817b1e434f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sales management decision rights", "children": [{"id": "100f73cb-a6af-425c-a6ae-f01a39202759", "type": "concept", "title": "Operating rhythms and inspection cadence"}, {"id": "c59e1df6-2b63-4f7b-91ef-628508c3373f", "type": "concept", "title": "Manager versus rep responsibilities"}, {"id": "54ac709f-b08d-4145-ab8b-e5c82932928c", "type": "concept", "title": "Short-term target pressure versus long-term customer trust"}, {"id": "13c748a8-dff5-4607-80f0-9d86dc52779f", "type": "concept", "title": "Governance of exceptions, discounts, and escalations"}], "description": "Sales managers make repeated choices about people, accounts, process, pricing, and performance. Students learn what decisions managers own and what evidence should guide them."}]}, {"id": "0c5b6f4f-9244-46d6-995b-8fc4bc1c2685", "type": "topic", "title": "Buyer Behavior, Customer Value, and Consultative Selling", "description": "Connect consumer and organizational buying behavior to relationship-centered sales practice.", "children": [{"id": "d18a31de-8364-4a70-86ec-f07862c019c5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Buyer decision processes", "children": [{"id": "dda5afc9-b411-43b3-aa61-36bc56ceb42e", "type": "concept", "title": "Consumer and organizational buying centers"}, {"id": "4a82dcac-5c0f-44bc-8a4e-aa8cddc96451", "type": "concept", "title": "Needs, triggers, constraints, and switching costs"}, {"id": "3d24b778-00b9-487e-a54c-ce6af5c2e9aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Rational, emotional, social, and political drivers"}, {"id": "49b8095a-cf42-44ae-bf1b-a6492e3a3322", "type": "concept", "title": "Post-purchase behavior and trust formation"}], "description": "Sales teams perform better when they understand how buyers perceive risk, evaluate 