ns and mutual action plans"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches students to allocate effort based on potential, fit, and strategic value."}, {"id": "63f6991e-1331-415d-b021-0794a015e4fa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Channel and partner coverage", "children": [{"id": "8a08edaa-476c-4c32-bed6-d06eb2c7abc5", "type": "concept", "title": "Direct versus indirect channel choices"}, {"id": "f0b380ba-b9ab-4307-aa79-5fb7e056cb34", "type": "concept", "title": "Partner selection and enablement"}, {"id": "b3c0b878-c5d8-4e37-837f-9e7f531741a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Channel conflict and rules of engagement"}, {"id": "276be55b-54cf-4ca6-9ce6-bb218ab66fc8", "type": "concept", "title": "Partner performance metrics"}], "description": "Students learn when direct sales should be complemented by partners, resellers, marketplaces, or distributors."}]}, {"id": "329f1941-60c7-4ed8-b6f5-71a771125c7a", "type": "topic", "title": "Forecasting, Pipeline Analytics, and Revenue Operations", "description": "Use pipeline data, sales stages, forecast methods, and revenue operations to guide decisions.", "children": [{"id": "d089ad3d-34b5-4bcd-bfde-a3012e8c790d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sales forecasting methods", "children": [{"id": "6fab9b50-46fa-4079-b76e-841ef6f52d0e", "type": "concept", "title": "Rep commit, manager judgment, stage-weighted, and model-based forecasts"}, {"id": "e512b804-cece-4f0a-8ae7-c65f77399260", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecast categories and confidence levels"}, {"id": "e8d39944-a9e2-4a7b-9128-2d1b2856582d", "type": "concept", "title": "Seasonality and sales cycle length"}, {"id": "46040fdc-6d29-42e2-8c3d-43821bbc1871", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecast bias and inspection"}], "description": "Forecasting turns pipeline uncertainty into managerial judgment. Students learn common approaches and failure modes."}, {"id": "08c1a8f1-3c57-4125-88a6-e46da7f9a0f8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pipeline analytics", "children": [{"id": "29e0c1d9-5ca9-427a